{room, key=cult_inner_sanctum, name=Inner Sanctum
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }

    {enter_message
        output={@
Red dots of light glow in a grid pattern over the single curved wall that
surrounds you. In the center of the room, hovering just below the ceiling,
is a large chrome ring. Every now and then it flickers a dim red.

Along the wall are high-back chairs. Five of them are occupied by **hooded figures**
sitting motionless.

The **masked figure** with the neon antlers turns to face you. Then stands motionless.

        }

        {logic, name=Deepgrid cult inner sanctum tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@
You are in what appears to be in inner sanctum.

Red dots of light glow in a grid pattern over the single curved wall that
surrounds you. In the center of the room, hovering just below the ceiling,
is a large chrome ring. Every now and then it flickers a dim red.

Along the wall are high-back chairs. Five of them are occupied by **hooded figures**
sitting motionless.

The **masked figure** with the neon antlers is standing there facing you.

            }
        }
    }

    {x_hooded
        {message
            output={@
You look at the hooded figures. Their faces are shrouded in shadow however
when the overhead ring flickers red circuitry patterns glitch deep within
their dark hoods.
They sit motionless.

            }
        }
    }

    {attack_hooded
        {message
            output={@
You contemplate attacking the hooded figures. But before you are able to fully
formulate your decision the figure with the antlers raises its left hand.

"Not wise, my friend."

You forget what you were just contemplating.

            }
        }
    }

    {x_masked
        {message
            output={@
You examine the masked figure with the antlers.
It raises its arms out into the air and says in an eerie deep voice,
"Friend, do you agree to be buried alive?"

            }
        }
    }



    {inject, logic=/look.inj }



    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_figure_hooded))
        {act, logic=x_hooded, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((attack_figure_hooded))
        {act, logic=attack_hooded, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_figure_masked))
        {act, logic=x_masked, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((attack_figure_masked))
        {move, logic=deepspace, tags=[player]
            output={@
Everything goes dark...

            }
        }
    }


    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((yes))
        {move, logic=multiplexer_home, tags=[player]
            output={@
The figure buries you alive...

            }
        }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((no))
        {move, logic=deepspace, tags=[player]
            output={@
Everything goes dark...

            }
        }
    }
}
